---
description: Never add Cursor git commit attribution in this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

When creating git commits or pull requests in this repository:

- Do NOT add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor co-author trailer
- Do NOT add `Made with Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or similar trailers
- Do NOT pass `--trailer` flags for Cursor attribution
- Use plain `git commit -m "message"` only
